<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE-Hanil Bank H1 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Hanil Bank H1 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>    Shr (won)		   198     vs	 106</p>
<p>    Net			 32.77     vs     17.62</p>
<p>    Revenue		1,378.42     vs  1,084.99</p>
<p>    Profit before tax     46.03     vs     22.72</p>
<p>Note - Hanil Bank is one of South Korea's leading commercial banks. The figures were provided by the Korea Listed Companies Association.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5647</p>
</text>
